{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/Amigos.gif?t=1746724636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kaporanga is a <strong>free party game</strong> with minigames made to play with your family and friends of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play online or locally, with total flexibility: connect multiple players per computer in any way you like \u2014 2 on one PC, 3 on another, 1 solo... it\u2019s up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/PARQUELAGE.gif?t=1746724636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>OLD-SCHOOL MINIGAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the games you used to play in your childhood with neighborhood friends, like Simon Says, Hot Potato, Musical Chairs, Memory, along with modern games set in places you already know \u2013 or NEED to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/PETP_com_PIM.gif?t=1746724636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>ACCESSIBILITY FOR EVERYONE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All mini-games are played using only the analog stick (or D-pad) and just 2 buttons! With different control schemes to be as accessible as possible, we also include a colorblind mode and narrated menus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/controles.png?t=1746724636\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There can only be one champion! Outsmart your friends, win the required number of minigames to come out on top, and raise that trophy high! <br><br><strong>LET\u2019S KAPORANGA!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/Final.png?t=1746724636\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665430?t=1746724636","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/e415afe9bb92d4d8fb00a3b9dba8a6cdf4d51642/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746724636","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/a1cd418cbe18189288e6320bfa4004866e25db19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746724636","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/a1cd418cbe18189288e6320bfa4004866e25db19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746724636","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/Amigos.gif?t=1746724636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kaporanga is a <strong>free party game</strong> with minigames made to play with your family and friends of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play online or locally, with total flexibility: connect multiple players per computer in any way you like \u2014 2 on one PC, 3 on another, 1 solo... it\u2019s up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/PARQUELAGE.gif?t=1746724636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>OLD-SCHOOL MINIGAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the games you used to play in your childhood with neighborhood friends, like Simon Says, Hot Potato, Musical Chairs, Memory, along with modern games set in places you already know \u2013 or NEED to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/PETP_com_PIM.gif?t=1746724636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>ACCESSIBILITY FOR EVERYONE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All mini-games are played using only the analog stick (or D-pad) and just 2 buttons! With different control schemes to be as accessible as possible, we also include a colorblind mode and narrated menus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/controles.png?t=1746724636\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There can only be one champion! Outsmart your friends, win the required number of minigames to come out on top, and raise that trophy high! <br><br><strong>LET\u2019S KAPORANGA!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/extras/Final.png?t=1746724636\" /></p>","developers":["Ape Roboto"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665430/75eec4ee2e78e92f6b9abb7d8146d3d5854724c2/header.jpg?t=174